OL,3,GNEWSASpeed cameras to be installed
OL,4,Aafter fatal crashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAverage speed cameras are to be
OL,7,Finstalled in three Devon villages for
OL,8,Fthe first time as part of a scheme to
OL,9,Fimprove safety.
OL,11,FNational Highways said the cameras
OL,12,Fwould be introduced on the A35 in
OL,13,FKilmington, Raymond's Hill and
OL,14,FWilmington and speed limits reduced on
OL,15,Fsome of a 14-mile section between
OL,16,FHoniton and Charmouth.
OL,18,FNational Highways figures for 2021 to
OL,19,F2025 showed there had been 62
OL,20,Fcollisions on the route, including four
OL,21,Ffatal incidents - 55% more crashes than
OL,22,Fon similar roads.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
