OL,3,GNEWSASpeed cameras to be installed
OL,4,Aafter fatal crashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack Mason, National Highways' South
OL,7,FWest road safety manager, said the
OL,8,Fscheme followed a long-term safety
OL,9,Freview and was part of an "ongoing
OL,10,Fcommitment" to reducing the number of
OL,11,Fpeople harmed on the region's roads.
